# Build context for Dockerfile.marketing: the Astro project in site/ plus
# repo markdown read at build time for /changelog/ and /docs/.
# Ignore everything, then re-include the site sources and those files.
*
!site/
!Dockerfile.marketing
!CHANGELOG.md
!README.md
!docs/
docs/**
!docs/sync-setup.md
!docs/kanban-format.md
!docs/a11y-checklist.md
!docs/sync-safety.md
# Local build output and tooling never enter the context (the image runs npm ci itself).
site/node_modules
site/dist
site/.astro
site/.proof-w1
